{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-1-3:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_1_3\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:soa:intro\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究流程表（SOA）按访视、时间窗/参考事件、必需评估、脚注、早期终止评估和安全随访列示。随访访视应按方案预定时间窗执行；所有访视应记录实际日期并计算与计划日期的偏差。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"chapter_input.resolved_facts.soa.visit_window_definitions.general\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:soa:abbreviations\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"缩写：NPS=双侧鼻息肉评分；VAS=视觉模拟量表；SNOT-22=22项鼻窦炎结局测试；ICE=intercurrent event（伴发事件）；AE=不良事件。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"chapter_input.resolved_facts.soa.footnote_bindings\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:soa:key_notes\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"第24周为主要终点评估访视，应尽量在计划时间窗内完成主要和次要终点评估。本方案未设置电话联系人访视；若试验参与者无法现场访视，可按方案允许的方式联系并记录，但电话访视不得替代第24周主要终点所需的NPS和鼻塞VAS评估。非计划联系应记录实际日期、时间及与计划访视的相对时间。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"chapter_input.resolved_facts.soa.visit_window_definitions;chapter_input.resolved_facts.soa.contact_visits\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:soa_table\",\n      \"kind\": \"table\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"table\": {\n        \"table_id\": \"table:soa:v2_n_1_3\",\n        \"block_id\": \"block:soa_table\",\n        \"schema_version\": \"structured_table_v1\",\n        \"title\": \"研究流程表（SOA）\",\n        \"role\": \"protocol_synopsis\",\n        \"domain\": \"schedule_of_activities\",\n        \"version\": 1,\n        \"header_row_count\": 1,\n        \"review_state\": \"ai_draft\",\n        \"source_locator\": \"chapter_input.resolved_facts.soa\",\n        \"word_layout\": {\n          \"orientation\": \"landscape\",\n          \"section_ordinal\": 6\n        },\n        \"columns\": [\n          {\n            \